{"seq":1,"slug":"rapid-detection-methods","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 快速检测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/rapid-detection-methods","wordCount":2127,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-食品安全科学-快速检测方法\">研究生 食品安全科学 — 快速检测方法</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>食品安全快速检测方法（Rapid Detection Methods）是指相比传统实验室标准方法，在分析时间、操作复杂度或检测通量方面具有显著优势的检测技术。传统微生物培养法需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> 小时甚至更长时间才能获得结果，而快速方法可以将检测时间压缩到数小时甚至数分钟，满足食品生产企业&quot;检测放行&quot;和监管部门&quot;现场快检&quot;的实际需求。快速检测技术已成为食品安全保障体系中不可或缺的技术支撑。</p>\n<p>主要技术类别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>免疫学方法</strong>：基于抗原-抗体特异性结合反应的检测技术</li>\n<li><strong>核酸扩增方法</strong>：基于DNA/RNA分子检测的高灵敏度技术</li>\n<li><strong>生物传感器</strong>：将生物识别元件与信号转换器件相结合的检测装置</li>\n<li><strong>光谱学方法</strong>：利用物质与电磁辐射相互作用特征进行快速无损分析</li>\n<li><strong>ATP生物发光法</strong>：基于荧光素酶-ATP反应的微生物快速计数和卫生监控方法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"免疫学快速检测技术\">免疫学快速检测技术</h3><p>**酶联免疫吸附测定（ELISA）**是最成熟的食品安全免疫学检测平台。竞争性ELISA和夹心ELISA是两种基本构型：</p>\n<p>夹心ELISA适用于分子量较大、具有多个抗原表位的靶标（如毒素蛋白、过敏原蛋白）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 包被</td>\n<td>捕获抗体固定于微孔板</td>\n<td>提供特异性识别位点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 加样</td>\n<td>加入样品/标准品</td>\n<td>靶标被捕获抗体结合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 检测抗体</td>\n<td>加入酶标记的第二抗体</td>\n<td>识别靶标的第二个表位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 显色</td>\n<td>加入酶底物</td>\n<td>酶催化产生有色产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 读数</td>\n<td>酶标仪测定吸光度</td>\n<td>定量分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ELISA的典型灵敏度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> ng/mL（ppb级），分析时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 小时。商业化ELISA试剂盒已广泛应用于真菌毒素（黄曲霉毒素B1、DON、玉米赤霉烯酮）、过敏原（花生、牛奶、麸质）和兽药残留（氯霉素、沙星类）的定量检测。</p>\n<p>**胶体金免疫层析（Lateral Flow Immunoassay, LFIA）**是最简便的现场快检技术。其核心结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[样品垫] --&gt; B[金标垫&lt;br&gt;胶体金-抗体结合物]&#10;    B --&gt; C[NC膜&lt;br&gt;检测线T+质控线C]&#10;    C --&gt; D[吸水垫]\">graph LR\n    A[样品垫] --&gt; B[金标垫&lt;br&gt;胶体金-抗体结合物]\n    B --&gt; C[NC膜&lt;br&gt;检测线T+质控线C]\n    C --&gt; D[吸水垫]</pre><p>样品通过毛细作用从样品垫向吸水垫方向流动，途经金标垫时携带胶体金标记的抗体，在检测线（T线）被捕获形成肉眼可见的红色条带。检测时间仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，无需仪器即可判读阳性/阴性结果。近年来荧光微球、量子点和磁性纳米粒子等新型标记材料的应用显著提升了LFIA的灵敏度和定量能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核酸扩增检测技术\">核酸扩增检测技术</h3><p>**实时荧光定量PCR（qPCR）**是食品病原微生物检测的金标准快速方法。其原理是在PCR扩增过程中实时监测荧光信号的积累，实现靶标核酸的定量检测。</p>\n<p>TaqMan探针法是qPCR最常用的检测化学：探针5&#39;端标记报告基团（FAM、VIC等），3&#39;端标记猝灭基团（BHQ、TAMRA等）。当Taq聚合酶的5&#39;→3&#39;外切核酸酶活性将探针水解时，报告基团与猝灭基团分离，荧光信号释放。</p>\n<p>qPCR的核心定量参数是Ct值（Cycle Threshold），即扩增曲线达到阈值荧光水平时的循环数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log N_0 = -\\frac{1}{\\log E} \\cdot Ct + C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为初始模板量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 为扩增效率（理想值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为常数。标准曲线法通过已知浓度梯度的标准品建立 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log N_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ct</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 线性关系实现绝对定量。</p>\n<p>食品病原菌qPCR检测的关键挑战是<strong>样品基质效应</strong>——食品中的PCR抑制物（多酚、脂肪、多糖、血红蛋白）可能导致假阴性。解决策略包括：优化DNA提取方法、加入内标（IAC）监控抑制效应、使用耐抑制的DNA聚合酶。</p>\n<p><strong>等温扩增技术</strong>突破了PCR对热循环仪的依赖：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LAMP（环介导等温扩增）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 等温条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> min完成扩增，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 条引物识别靶序列上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 个位点，特异性高。扩增产物可通过浊度（焦磷酸镁沉淀）或荧光染料目视判读</li>\n<li><strong>RPA（重组酶聚合酶扩增）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>42</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">42°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 等温扩增，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> min即可完成，适合现场快检</li>\n<li><strong>CRISPR-Cas检测</strong>：将等温扩增与CRISPR-Cas12/Cas13的反式切割活性结合（如DETECTR和SHERLOCK平台），实现attomolar级灵敏度检测</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生物传感器技术\">生物传感器技术</h3><p>生物传感器由生物识别元件（抗体、适配体、酶、分子印迹聚合物）和信号转换器（电化学、光学、压电）两部分组成。</p>\n<p><strong>电化学生物传感器</strong>通过检测生物识别事件引起的电信号变化（电流、电位或阻抗）实现检测：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安培型传感器：检测氧化还原电流变化，如酶传感器检测有机磷农药对乙酰胆碱酯酶的抑制</li>\n<li>阻抗型传感器：检测抗原-抗体结合引起的界面阻抗变化，无需标记</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>表面等离子体共振（SPR）传感器</strong>是无标记实时检测的代表性技术。当靶标分子与传感器表面固定的配体结合时，表面折射率发生变化，导致SPR角移动。BIAcore系统是商业化SPR平台的代表，检测灵敏度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ng/mL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 级别。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光谱学快速筛查\">光谱学快速筛查</h3><p><strong>近红外光谱（NIR）<strong>和</strong>拉曼光谱</strong>在食品掺假和品质快速筛查中展现出独特优势：</p>\n<p>NIR利用分子中C-H、O-H、N-H等化学键在近红外区（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>780</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">780</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">780</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2500</span></span></span></span></span> nm）的倍频和合频吸收，结合化学计量学（PLS、PCA）建立定量/定性预测模型。已在肉类掺假鉴别、乳品成分分析和谷物品质分类中实现工业化应用。</p>\n<p>表面增强拉曼光谱（SERS）通过金属纳米结构的局域表面等离子体效应将拉曼信号增强 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{14}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍，使痕量分析成为可能。SERS在农药残留快速检测中表现出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ppb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 级灵敏度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>比较ELISA和胶体金免疫层析在食品安全现场快检中的适用场景，分析各自的优势和局限。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个基于LAMP技术的沙门氏菌现场快速检测方案，包括引物设计策略、样品前处理和结果判读方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论qPCR检测食品中致病菌时&quot;活菌vs死菌&quot;的区分问题，以及PMA-qPCR（叠氮溴化丙锭预处理）方法的原理和局限。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析CRISPR-Cas检测平台（如SHERLOCK）相比传统qPCR的潜在优势和商业化挑战。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某食品企业需要选择一种农药残留快速筛查方法用于原料验收环节。比较ELISA、胶体金试纸条和拉曼光谱三种方案的技术经济可行性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>综述文章</strong>：Vemula et al. (2023) &quot;Recent Advances in Rapid Detection Methods for Foodborne Pathogens&quot; <em>Comprehensive Reviews in Food Science and Food Safety</em></li>\n<li><strong>CRISPR检测</strong>：Kellner et al. (2019) &quot;SHERLOCK: Nucleic Acid Detection with CRISPR Nucleases&quot; <em>Nature Protocols</em></li>\n<li><strong>生物传感器</strong>：Turner (2013) &quot;Biosensors: Sense and Sensibility&quot; <em>Chemical Society Reviews</em></li>\n<li><strong>中国标准</strong>：GB/T系列食品安全快速检测方法标准——了解中国已标准化的快速检测技术</li>\n<li><strong>仪器资源</strong>：了解Neogen、Romer Labs和bioMérieux等国际食品安全检测解决方案提供商的产品线</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>食品安全快速检测技术正在从传统实验室走向生产线和田间地头，从专业人员操作走向简便化和自动化。免疫学方法以其简便性和成本优势在现场快检中占据主导地位；核酸扩增技术以高灵敏度和高特异性成为实验室快速确认的首选；生物传感器和光谱学方法则代表着实时、无损、在线检测的未来方向。理解不同快速检测技术的原理、性能特点和适用场景，是食品安全检测领域研究者和管理者做出正确技术选择的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 快速检测方法","id":"研究生-食品安全科学-快速检测方法"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"免疫学快速检测技术","id":"免疫学快速检测技术"},{"level":3,"text":"核酸扩增检测技术","id":"核酸扩增检测技术"},{"level":3,"text":"生物传感器技术","id":"生物传感器技术"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱学快速筛查","id":"光谱学快速筛查"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品追溯体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/control-systems/traceability-systems"},"next":{"title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品分子诊断技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/molecular-diagnostics-food"}}